      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel like a role you can no longer inhabit; that is a form of mourning for a lost self. Trying to maintain a performance when your core sense of self has been diminished is exhausting. Perhaps instead of forcing yourself to be \"me,\" you could grant yourself permission to simply *be* in this space of exhaustion for a while. Small acts of kindness toward your present self, even if they feel meaningless, are a start to building something new.",
